<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1196) <span class="when">Oct 3, 2026</span></h2>
<ul>
<li>Small fixes and improvements.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<div class="earlier">Earlier updates</div>
<h3>1.0 (build 1178) <span class="when">Oct 3, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Quiet jumps:</b> clicking a note, its timecode or a marker no longer plays a repeating snatch of sound. Only dragging the playhead plays audio while stopped.</li>
<li>Small fixes and improvements.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1174) <span class="when">Oct 3, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Spell check in comments:</b> notes and replies get the Mac&#8217;s red underline, with right-click suggestions, and optional autocorrect (Edit ▸ Spelling in Comments).</li>
<li>Small fixes and improvements.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1170) <span class="when">Oct 3, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Timeline markers:</b> notes show as a blue line, markup as an amber triangle on the top edge.</li>
<li><b>Replies:</b> a Send button appears beside a reply as you type.</li>
<li>Small fixes and improvements.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1165) <span class="when">Oct 2, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Menus during playback:</b> the menu bar&#8217;s menus and submenus stay put and take clicks while a clip plays.</li>
<li>Small fixes and improvements.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1162) <span class="when">Oct 2, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Steadier while playing:</b> menus no longer flicker or miss clicks during playback, and the toolbar keeps its width.</li>
<li><b>Volume:</b> the Sound button opens a vertical volume slider with mute at the bottom.</li>
<li>Small fixes and improvements.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1157) <span class="when">Oct 2, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>Small fixes and improvements.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1153) <span class="when">Oct 2, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Volume:</b> the arrow beside the Sound button opens a volume slider.</li>
<li>Small fixes and improvements.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
